d paths and streets.","latitude":42.3622805,"longitude":-71.0556796,"source_label":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","source_url":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap node 5922346085","informationSourceLabel":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/rose-fitzgerald-kennedy-greenway/04-rose-kennedy-greenway-boston-ma-20141226-105944-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rose_Kennedy_Greenway_-_Boston%2C_MA_-_20141226_105944.jpg","imageAuthor":"Daderot","imageLicense":"CC0","imageAlt":"North End parks and gardens at Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway"}},{"id":"06c97347-2507-47f8-8662-eda64e391c16","slug":"chinatown-park","name":"Chinatown Park","feature_type":"destination","description":"The southern Greenway park at Chinatown provides gardens, seating, and a gateway near Chinatown and South Station. Events and maintenance can change usable space, and public restrooms are not guaranteed in the park.","latitude":42.35115,"longitude":-71.0597,"source_label":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","source_url":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"reviewed map placement","coordinateSource":"AuditMap reviewed Greenway map placement","informationSourceLabel":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/rose-fitzgerald-kennedy-greenway/03-rose-kennedy-greenway-p1010933-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rose_Kennedy_Greenway_P1010933.jpg","imageAuthor":"NewtonCourt","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Chinatown Park at Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway"}},{"id":"15d7d96e-c4fb-4d2f-b784-a6745b821627","slug":"armenian-heritage-park","name":"Armenian Heritage Park","feature_type":"destination","description":"This Greenway parcel near Faneuil Hall includes the Abstract Sculpture and Labyrinth. The sculpture changes configuration seasonally; use paths respectfully and check programming before expecting an event.","latitude":42.3609223,"longitude":-71.053239,"source_label":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","source_url":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap way 776291660","informationSourceLabel":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/rose-fitzgerald-kennedy-greenway/01-greenway-aerial-shot-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Greenway_Aerial_Shot.jpg","imageAuthor":"Greenway Conservancy","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Armenian Heritage Park at Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway"}},{"id":"8d7e64d4-9f14-41ef-babe-5ab185de35c7","slug":"harbor-fog-sculpture","name":"Harbor Fog sculpture","feature_type":"destination","description":"Harbor Fog is an interactive public artwork in the Wharf District that uses sound, light, and mist. Effects may be seasonal or paused for weather, maintenance, water use, or nearby events.","latitude":42.3596,"longitude":-71.05275,"source_label":"Rose Fitzgerald Kennedy Greenway Conservancy","source_url":"https://www.rosekennedygreenway.org/info/","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"reviewed map placement","coordinateSource":"A